                        "form": "lisibles"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b2098a10-2432-4711-9a80-8bb0935ddcad",
                        "entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "tags": [
                            "Acadie"
                        ],
                        "form": "lisable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "994f32ea-b8a2-3d16-967f-2cdc832215ba",
                        "entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est aisé à lire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b7d179f-11fd-4688-8fc9-96bc3a281ce6",
                                "sense_id": "994f32ea-b8a2-3d16-967f-2cdc832215ba",
                                "text": "Feuilles d’impression maculées ou qui maculent, sont des feuilles qui, ayant été battues par le relieur, en sortant pour ainsi dire de la presse, & avant d’être bien seches, sont peu lisibles, les lignes paroissant se doubler les unes dans les autres ; […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2eaef16-7098-4ad3-a150-679e123f3fc5",
                                "sense_id": "994f32ea-b8a2-3d16-967f-2cdc832215ba",
                                "text": "Il plia la feuille, l’introduisit dans une enveloppe sur laquelle il gribouilla le nom et l’adresse de son ami. Il examina quelques secondes la suscription difficilement lisible […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee1d6a65-b5aa-4f7d-97ee-0b82fcf69058",
                                "sense_id": "994f32ea-b8a2-3d16-967f-2cdc832215ba",
                                "text": "Le Christ sur la croix a une certaine allure avec son ventre creusé et ses côtes lisibles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30993ba2-ce3e-38b9-94c9-555386c0a629",
                        "entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est accessible à la lecture ; qui mérite d’être lu."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1c534bb-adf6-4226-89bc-e1ad164a4cce",
                                "sense_id": "30993ba2-ce3e-38b9-94c9-555386c0a629",
                                "text": "Voici ce qu'il m'en a dit : « On prétend que je ne suis lisible que par peu de gens, c'est faux, j'ai une lectrice qui est une ouvrière et qui m'écrit les choses les plus vraies sur mes personnages, […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d30af3f-2d41-3a79-9c74-7f0744e4fe74",
                        "entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clair ; compréhensible ; limpide."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83a433db-9c87-4ee5-8cf0-589409a184e7",
                                "sense_id": "4d30af3f-2d41-3a79-9c74-7f0744e4fe74",
                                "text": "Les options sont un outil important de la politique de prix. Leur seul risque est de rendre l'offre trop complexe et peu lisible, et de renchérir excessivement le coût si elles sont trop nombreuses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "384ca2e6-1a67-4e7c-8ab7-2da0016ea34f",
                                "sense_id": "4d30af3f-2d41-3a79-9c74-7f0744e4fe74",
                                "text": "Cet amoncellement de mesures rend par conséquent cette politique peu lisible : qui pourrait aujourd'hui dresser la liste exhaustive des multiples dispositifs qui la constituent ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3cdcf36-e585-4265-bd02-bb50eaf62d8b",
                                "sense_id": "4d30af3f-2d41-3a79-9c74-7f0744e4fe74",
                                "text": "On retrouve chez Abramow un héritage lisible de Guy Bourdin (1928-1991), immense photographe des années 1970, dont les cadrages acrobatiques, et les couleurs éclatantes, rendaient les mannequins à la fois ultrasexys et parfaitement puissantes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35ca4495-a0e3-4fde-a219-dbf5e7724eb2",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "target_lang_word": "leserlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "leserlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaa5b865-5227-3547-952d-75e807b2c7bb",
                                        "entry_id": "1b4aeeaf-fccd-3d02-aa07-862d09d538f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(vom Schriftbild her) einfach oder angenehm zu lesen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c15699d-736d-4d5e-bc73-7e338c6fae2e",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa5b865-5227-3547-952d-75e807b2c7bb",
                                                "text": "Deine Handschrift ist leserlich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8855d8d7-966b-4bbc-b898-e499e8cd8bd9",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa5b865-5227-3547-952d-75e807b2c7bb",
                                                "text": "„«Können Sie meine Handschrift lesen?» «Ja, Genosse Bauer, alles leserlich», sagte Jalkotzy.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "607001c3-9564-4add-b1f5-0221d3d937ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "target_lang_word": "lesbar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lesbar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33ea9ed6-084c-3e95-bf88-f1a6dc1f1959",
                                        "entry_id": "53eacfbf-bee4-3b34-839b-a6d4cfa76c80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "möglich, gelesen zu werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cf86f59-b8af-465f-a461-565328ea66c3",
                                                "sense_id": "33ea9ed6-084c-3e95-bf88-f1a6dc1f1959",
                                                "text": "Die Daten auf der CD sind lesbar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "120ee362-41b4-4790-89d4-179bea36471c",
                                                "sense_id": "33ea9ed6-084c-3e95-bf88-f1a6dc1f1959",
                                                "text": "Oh, das ist ja eine lesbare Arztunterschrift!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f7e026f-16f6-4e8b-a026-279842ff04fb",
                                                "sense_id": "33ea9ed6-084c-3e95-bf88-f1a6dc1f1959",
                                                "text": "Es wurde dann später eine lesbarere Übersetzung angefertigt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17d3ed2a-8288-424a-8fa9-9029e483c3e5",
                                                "sense_id": "33ea9ed6-084c-3e95-bf88-f1a6dc1f1959",
                                                "text": "Bis hierhin kann man den Text entziffern, und dann folgen einige nicht lesbare Wörter."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4eab29b4-a796-4694-abcb-394402d82ee3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1613a68-81cc-352d-8421-355f16176215",
                        "target_lang_word": "readable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "readable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02ef8d96-8f3f-36fc-93dc-700e86eb79e8",
                                        "entry_id": "ef1f6739-acf5-39dc-8323-7e8f8748cf4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Legible, possible to read or at least decipher."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of handwriting"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee84dd36-b82d-48d4-bd73-1fa952591245",
                                                "sense_id": "02ef8d96-8f3f-36fc-93dc-700e86eb79e8",
                                                "text": "If that sign were still readable we'd know where we are!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cfc6c59-9aae-3839-8a97-99bb763d114f",
                                        "entry_id": "ef1f6739-acf5-39dc-8323-7e8f8748cf4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Which can be read—i.e. accessed or played—by a certain technical type of device."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8b09052-7ee0-4d12-bf1b-5e2ccf8ec20a",
                                                "sense_id": "1cfc6c59-9aae-3839-8a97-99bb763d114f",
                                                "text": "No sale, those aren't readable with my DVD-player!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                        "entry_id": "ef1f6739-acf5-39dc-8323-7e8f8748cf4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enjoyable to read, of an acceptable stylistic quality or at least functionally composed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a book"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "624084f0-841e-4c72-a316-ba5f0afa98ec",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "These assembly instructions aren't readable, I still don't have a clue how to start!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7404a75d-ad24-4842-ace9-bd90b5764071",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "I have been twice at the Museum looking out for Friedrich Books,—that I might examine them a little, and see whether they were worth buying. […] I have got a rather curious new German Book upon Naples and Masaniello (chiefly) whh often made me remember you. To one who knows the streets edifices &c the thing may be readabler: I mean to send it you to Scotsbg the day after tomorrow, along with my Mother’s Magazine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ce4bff-1518-46b5-9ff2-ba9fedaafe5a",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "Your August Potentiality will not fail to observe that those spiritual adumbrations are not evanescent or fugaceous, a latrocinous cheat, repugnant to common-sense and an insult to the most parvanimous of human intelligences, but tangible entities, altogether stationary, and as visible to every eye as the readablest of printed work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31dd4d70-ae97-4adb-a81d-839eed47113d",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "With this brief preamble I can, without being more than usually misunderstood, proceed to my duty of reviewing the readablest and quite the maddest book produced by the war: namely, The Prussian Hath Said in His Heart, by Cecil Chesterton, who says very truly that it is what a man says in his heart that matters, and not what he says in Hyde Park."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a40f35f-0f7a-42fb-8801-8220177ef248",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "After his childhood, which is the readablest part of even the worst autobiography, his attempts to escape from his subject are pitiable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae06bccf-41ac-4a0f-824e-7099145aee14",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "So far as cartoons are concerned these days, nothing—not even sewage works—is sacred, and everything is thereby readabler and believabler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eac14d8-fb9c-4ed2-afee-6d1cda25b260",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "This is a masterly work of condensation, omitting nothing of importance and providing a most readable book that for a modest half-crown is incredibly good value."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df484ae-43cb-4b83-9fea-4941bc89e373",
                                                "sense_id": "5ae36b7a-b4e0-3b7d-b497-7997c6878e76",
                                                "text": "A god's blue fire gone, the man is left like a page in the grate, apparently unchanged. Ash-gray, granted, and somewhat curled at the edge, but readable. Readable, he thinks. Until the passage—cat's paw?—backwash?—up the chimney?—whump-whump, rotorblades of a distant hummingbird, let's say: then all at once, old cobweb upwhipped, the words vanish."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5093f65-c014-4a4d-afd0-99e0a1f4de05",
